  NO OUTCOME IS ASSERTED - THIS IS THE DECISIVE POINT
    R-T7 forbids asserting a pass or a failure that the run did not produce.
    Accordingly this file records only which tests EXIST. The absence of
    failure, error and skipped elements MUST NOT be read as an assertion that
    these tests passed. The outcome-count attributes a native report carries
    (failures, errors, skipped) are deliberately omitted for the same reason,
