    One temptation was specifically declined. The error-path test below causes
    the persistence exception to be thrown by a mock and then asserts an
    internal-server-error status with a plain-text body, so the test HANDLES
    that exception rather than failing with it. No failure element and no
    stack trace was invented on the strength of the import alone.

  THE REPLACEMENT CONTRACT
    When a genuine JDK 8 capture becomes possible, the native report at
    target/surefire-reports/TEST-<fully-qualified-class>.xml REPLACES this file
